```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Agent as Agent (WebMCP / headless)
  participant Exec as executeWebMcpTool
  participant Store as agentFocus store
  participant Net as NetSession
  participant VP as Viewport (outline + badge)

  Agent->>Exec: spawn_prop / set_entity_field / …
  Exec->>Exec: handler mutates world
  Exec->>Store: track(agentId, displayName, entityIds)
  alt session.connected
    Store->>Net: send agent_focus
    Net-->>VP: remote peers apply focus
  end
  Store->>VP: outlineLayers + badge projector
  Note over Store,VP: TTL 3.5s → prune → fade out
```
